    "code": " n,m=map(int,input().split())\n\nmax=0\n\nmin=0\n\nif (m==0 and n!=1) or m>9*n:\n\n    print(-1,-1)\n\nelif n==1 and m==0:\n\n    print(0,0)\n\nelse:\n\n    min=10**(n-1)\n\n    for i in range(m-1):\n\n        a=(i//9)\n\n        min+=10**a\n\n    max=0\n\n    for i in range(m):\n\n      b=(n-1-i//9)\n\n      max+=10**b\n\n    print(min,max)\n",
